1
00:06:22,674 --> 00:06:23,549
{\an8}[DEEP IN THE MOUNTAINS]

2
00:06:23,550 --> 00:06:24,927
{\an8}WHEN THINGS AREN'T GOING WELL,
THE MATTERS ARE GETTING WORSE.

3
00:17:03,189 --> 00:17:08,319
<i>I feel as if I were born again</i>

4
00:17:09,154 --> 00:17:14,617
<i>I have changed in every way</i>

5
00:17:15,827 --> 00:17:19,121
<i>Ever since I met you</i>

6
00:17:19,122 --> 00:17:22,207
<i>I've become a new person</i>

7
00:17:22,208 --> 00:17:28,047
<i>My mother's more surprised than anyone</i>

8
00:17:33,052 --> 00:17:38,808
<i>It's amazing to see my love for you</i>

9
00:17:39,726 --> 00:17:43,813
<i>It's refreshing to see myself this way</i>

10
00:17:46,316 --> 00:17:50,944
<i>If I feel this way every day</i>

11
00:17:50,945 --> 00:17:54,032
<i>This harsh world will be worth living in</i>

12
00:33:32,302 --> 00:33:35,139
EXIT

13
00:38:33,395 --> 00:38:36,690
{\an8}MONDAY, MAY 5TH
3:08

